Apply the exact gate to CoverageFinding: Exact counts, independent-source accounting, and no false representativeness claim. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
